# Device tree overlays the package installs. SOURCE PREFIX-NAME.dts installs as
# OVERLAY_DIR/PREFIX/omarchy-NAME.dtbo (packaging/build-dtbo; OVERLAY_DIR is
# the constant in packaging/omarchy-ane-dt). PREFIX selects the board device
# trees by file name. STATE: enabled applies by default; opt-in applies only
# after the owner opts in (the overlay's "omarchy,opt-in" string, listed in
# /etc/omarchy-platform/dtb-overlays.opt-in); disabled is not installed.
# Tested SoCs are enabled (T8103, T6001, T6021, T6020). Untested SoCs are opt-in.
# SoCs that no driver binds are disabled. The SoC table is in README.md,
# "Chip coverage".
#
# PREFIX  SOURCE                          STATE
t8103     t8103-ane.dts                   enabled
t6000     t6000-ane.dts                   opt-in
t6001     t6001-ane.dts                   enabled
t6002     t6002-ane.dts                   opt-in
t8112     t8112-ane.dts                   opt-in
t6020     t6020-ane.dts                   enabled
t6021     t6021-ane.dts                   enabled
t6021     t6021-uboot-serial-stdin.dts    opt-in
t6022     t6022-ane.dts                   opt-in
